This article lists all [[Administrative divisions of Burawa|administrations]] in [[Burawa]], the largest country by population in [[Southwestern Kaftia]]. Administrations are the top-level administrative divisions of Burawa, categorised as metropolitan administrations, urban administrations, and rural administrations.

There are eight metropolitan administrations, 188 urban administrations, and 34 rural administrations, for a total of 230 administrations.

== Metropolitan administrations ==

Metropolitan administrations serve as regional governing bodies for groups of urban administrations, handling shared services such as transportation and utilities.

